# UBI — No AI Slop

Sources: [unslop-ui-skill](https://github.com/claudiusararu/unslop-ui-skill), [design-slop](https://github.com/wpgaurav/design-slop).

## Product job
Map-first nightlife locator for Lima. Hierarchy: **map + pins > sheet > chrome**. Decoration never outrank the job.

## Hard bans
- No indigo/violet default, no purple-blue gradient washes, no mesh/aurora/blob wallpaper on Map
- No glassmorphism on every card — at most ONE frosted sheet (Map bottom sheet)
- No gradient-clipped display text; no neon text-shadow logo glow
- No gradient primary buttons as default — solid accent CTA; gold shimmer only when LIVE
- No thick borders (≥2px) on rounded cards
- No weight-900-everywhere; display condensed for event titles only; UI labels 600–700
- No spaced ALL-CAPS eyebrow pills stacked over every heading
- No glow spam: heat rings ≤1.35× pin, low opacity, breathe ≤+15%; dim non-selected when sheet open
- No emoji-as-icons; no Inter/Geist as the brand face
- No em-dashes in copy; specific Lima vernacular over filler

## Prefer
- Barranco ink `#0C0B0A` / `#161412` + coral accent `#E85D3B` + brass `#C4A574` — never mint neon or rainbow genre colors
- Asymmetry (search offset, edge scrubber)
- Genre marks as the pin (shape + color), titles only in sheet
- Real empty/loading/error states when touching a screen
- One primary action per surface

## Finish gate
Before shipping UI: mood ≤ purpose? each glow/glass/card earning place? recognizable as UBI not “generic nightlife template”?
